SUMMARY:Recheck Run Track Core Web Vitals in PageSpeed Insights
DESCRIPTION:Re-run Google PageSpeed Insights on mobile and desktop
  for these pages: https://runtrack-orpin.vercel.app/\n
 https://runtrack-orpin.vercel.app/athletes/1?weekStart=2026-11-09\n
  Run three valid PSI lab tests per page and device. Report medians.
  Exclude failed runs with reasons. Compare field data separately.
  Homepage field baseline on 2026-11-16: PSI showed No Data. No URL-level
  or origin-level field LCP\, INP\, or CLS values were available.
  Homepage lab baseline (3 runs each): Mobile median Performance 100\,
  FCP 0.8 s\, LCP 0.8 s\, TBT 0 ms\, CLS 0\, Speed Index 0.8 s.
  Desktop median Performance 94\, FCP 0.2 s\, LCP 0.2 s\, TBT 10 ms\,
  CLS 0.149\, Speed Index 0.3 s.
  Desktop CLS culprit: leaderboard row moving during data-driven sorting.
  Fix deployed in commit 94df2f8 stabilizes the leaderboard during loading.
  Record whether field data is URL-level or origin-level. Never treat lab
  results as field data or claim Core Web Vitals improved without fresh
  field data. Include before/after\, run counts\, failed tests\, conditions
  and remaining issues.

END:VEVENT
